        "literal inputs compile through explicit v2 and auto with actualMode=v2 and exact source/plist literal retention",
        "both invalid fixtures have exact diagnostic codes and zero-based UTF16 ranges",
        "actual unsigned and signed C ABI entrypoints in v2/auto reject with no plist or signature response",
        "Legacy invocation counts and CLI/LSP scope require independent root producers"
      ],
